  "description": "No new clothes for a whole year?! \n\nAfter finding out her rent is going to increase, Ji-Na Yun decides it's time for her to move. But wait... She's broke because she spent all her money on clothes! Join Ji-Na on her year-long challenge to not buy any new clothing. Will she be able to end her addiction to shopping? \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
